{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736130/extras/8d3e842e0247d73d71f4fcb27baba70a.avif?t=1751492507\" width=250 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to learn how to read your favorite Japanese Manga?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or have a trip to Japan planned and want to impress your friends!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey into an immersive playful world with two friendly Japanese Shiba Pups as they guide you on your way to Japanese Hiragana and Katakana Proficiency!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Study the specific Japanese character group sheet you want to focus on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Chose your preferred mini game (Pop It!) or (Fetch It!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Master and Win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the faster you learn Hiragana and Katakana! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you at the Dojo! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember. NEVER BE GAME OVER\u2122</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736130?t=1751492507","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736130/6c18b9a74df46df711e06cbf1d819261d23cbb9a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751492507","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736130/d4922bbcd43a78625d18bdd02f5e6112bc9438a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751492507","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736130/d4922bbcd43a78625d18bdd02f5e6112bc9438a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751492507","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descri